Notice of changes (AGPL-3.0 section 5(a)):

2026-11-12  Renamed the app from Roamies to Hanami: the product name, window titles, tray and
            menu text, panel, setup guide and notification copy, the default character's name,
            the agent's description of itself and the app, and the About page, which credits
            the original project, its author and its licence. The program installed on Linux is
            `hanami`; the app identifier is com.hanami.assistant. Internal names (code
            identifiers, ROAMIES_* environment variables, the roamies-voice and roamies-hands
            helpers, data folders, the keyring service com.kenkai.roamies) are unchanged.
            In-app updates were switched off until Hanami's own repository is set
            (FORK_REPO in showcase/tauri/src-tauri/src/main.rs), so this build never
            installs upstream Roamies releases.

Earlier changes made in this repository on top of upstream Roamies (Linux desktop actions,
dictation, voice answers to permission questions, money tracking from bank mails and others)
are recorded in its git history.

Third-party components keep their own licences: see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
